import fs from 'node:fs';import crypto from 'node:crypto';import path from 'node:path';import {fileURLToPath} from 'node:url';import {dataModeling,dataTeaser} from './data-modeling.mjs';import {agentPage,AGENTS_DETAIL} from './agents.mjs';
const ROOT=path.resolve(path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)),'..');const D=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(ROOT,'content.json')));const DP=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(ROOT,'assets/credentials/document-pages.json')));
const E=s=>String(s??'').replaceAll('&','&amp;').replaceAll('<','&lt;').replaceAll('>','&gt;').replaceAll('"','&quot;');const pad=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');
const SL=['iccn','indonesia-mengglobal','unesco-undp','timur-growth','titik-terang','iluni-ui','youthranger','biru-muda','pt-pindad','study-hub'];
let lang='en',route='',base='';const T=v=>typeof v==='object'&&v!==null?(v[lang]??v.en??''):v??'';const L=(en,id,nl)=>T({en,id,nl});const U=k=>T(D.UI[k]);const ASSET_VER=(()=>{const h=crypto.createHash('sha1');for(const f of ['assets/site.css','assets/revision.css','assets/polish.css','assets/data-modeling.css','assets/data-modeling.js','assets/site.js','assets/revision.js','assets/polish.js']){try{h.update(fs.readFileSync(path.join(ROOT,f)));}catch{}}return h.digest('hex').slice(0,8);})();
// CSS/JS diberi cap versi dari isinya: header Vercel meng-cache /assets/* selama 24 jam,
// jadi tanpa ini pengunjung lama masih memakai stylesheet basi setelah deploy. Gambar
// sengaja TIDAK diberi versi supaya tetap memanfaatkan cache panjang.
const A=s=>{const u=base+s.replace(/^\//,'');return /\.(css|js)$/.test(s)?u+'?v='+ASSET_VER:u;};const target=(r,l=lang)=>[l==='nl'?'':l,r,'index.html'].filter(Boolean).join('/');const H=(r,l=lang)=>path.posix.relative(path.posix.dirname(target(route)),target(r,l))||'index.html';
const link=(r,label,cls='text-link')=>`<a class="${cls}" href="${H(r)}">${label}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>`;
// Kartu video di galeri memakai <video> bisu+berulang, bukan hanya poster, supaya bisa
// diputar otomatis saat terlihat dan saat kursor mengarah — sama seperti galeri Our Work CAP.
// preload="none": tidak ada byte video yang diunduh sampai benar-benar diputar.
// Poster <img> yang menentukan ukuran kartu (rasio ASLI berkas, bukan angka rasio di data),
// lalu <video> ditumpuk persis di atasnya. Dengan begitu tidak ada yang terpotong dan video
// mengisi kotak yang sama. preload="none": video belum diunduh sampai benar-benar diputar.
const mediaThumb=(m,alt='',cls='')=>m.type==='video'
  ?`<span class="media-shot">${img(m.poster,alt,cls)}<video class="media-video" poster="${A(m.poster)}" muted loop playsinline preload="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><source src="${A(m.file)}" type="video/mp4"></video></span>`
  :img(m.poster,alt,cls);
// Nama berkas screenshot dipakai sebagai label slide. Awalan angka hanya untuk
// mengatur urutan (fitur unggulan lebih dulu), jadi dibuang dari tampilan.
const shotLabel=f=>f.replace(/\.\w+$/,'').replace(/^\d+-/,'').replace(/-/g,' ')
  .replace(/\b([a-z])/g,(m,c)=>c.toUpperCase()).replace(/\bAi\b/g,'AI').replace(/\bCv\b/g,'CV').replace(/\bIelts\b/g,'IELTS');
const img=(p,alt='',cls='',eager=false)=>`<img src="${A(p)}" alt="${E(alt)}" class="${cls}" ${eager?'fetchpriority="high"':'loading="lazy"'} decoding="async">`;
const tag=s=>`<span class="eyebrow">${E(s)}</span>`;const chips=arr=>`<div class="chips">${arr.map(s=>`<span>${E(s)}</span>`).join('')}</div>`;
const fold=(text,num='01',cl='')=>`<div class="fold-art ${cl}" aria-hidden="true"><i class="plane plane-a"></i><i class="plane plane-b"></i><i class="plane plane-c"></i><span class="fold-no">${num}</span><strong>${E(text)}</strong><small>LEADERSHIP<br>&amp;<br>COMMUNITY<span class="red-line"></span></small></div>`;
const heads=(ey,title,desc='',cls='')=>`<header class="page-intro ${cls}">${tag(ey)}<h1>${title}</h1>${desc?`<p class="intro-copy">${desc}</p>`:''}</header>`;
const sect=(title,body,id='',cls='')=>`<section ${id?`id="${id}"`:''} class="section ${cls}"><div class="section-head reveal"><h2>${title}</h2><span class="section-rule"></span></div>${body}</section>`;
function nav(){const ns=[['',U('navHome')],['work',U('navWork')],['creative-work',L('Creative Work','Karya Kreatif','Creatief Werk')],['data-modeling',L('Data Modeling','Data Modeling','Datamodellering')],['research',U('navResearch')],['education',L('About & Experience','Tentang & Pengalaman','Over & Ervaring')],['leadership',U('navLeadership')],['documents',L('CV & Documents','CV & Dokumen','CV & Documenten')],['contact',U('navContact')]];return `<a class="skip" href="#main">${L('Skip to content','Ke konten','Naar inhoud')}</a><header class="site-header"><a class="wordmark" data-locale="${lang.toUpperCase()}" href="${H('')}">EGGAN<small>NACHSON SILUETA</small></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="${L('Primary','Utama','Hoofdnavigatie')}">${[['',U('navHome')],['education',U('navEducation')],['work',U('navWork')],['creative-work',L('Creative','Kreatif','Creatief')],['data-modeling',L('Data','Data','Data')],['research',U('navResearch')],['leadership',U('navLeadership')],['contact',U('navContact')]].map(([r,n])=>`<a href="${H(r)}" ${(r ? route===r||route.startsWith(r+'/') : route==='')?'aria-current="page"':''}>${n}</a>`).join('')}</nav><div class="header-tools"><label class="sr-only" for="language">${L('Language','Bahasa','Taal')}</label><select id="language" aria-label="${L('Language','Bahasa','Taal')}">${['en','id','nl'].map(l=>`<option value="${H(route,l)}" ${l===lang?'selected':''}>${l.toUpperCase()}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="icon-button theme-toggle header-theme" aria-label="${L('Change colour theme','Ganti tema warna','Kleurthema wijzigen')}">◐</button><button class="menu-toggle" aria-controls="menu-dialog" aria-haspopup="dialog">Menu <i class="dot"></i></button></div><div class="scroll-line"></div></header><dialog id="menu-dialog" class="menu-dialog"><div class="menu-top"><span class="wordmark" data-locale="${lang.toUpperCase()}">EGGAN<small>NACHSON SILUETA</small></span><button data-close>${U('close')} ×</button></div><div class="menu-inner"><nav aria-label="${L('All pages','Semua halaman','Alle pagina’s')}">${ns.map(([r,n],i)=>`<a style="--i:${i}" href="${H(r)}"><small>${pad(i+1)}</small>${n}<span>↗</span></a>`).join('')}</nav><aside><div class="menu-portrait">${planes()}${img('assets/profile-nobg.png','Eggan Nachson Silueta')}</div><p class="menu-location">The Hague ↔ Jakarta</p><div class="menu-languages">${[['nl','Nederlands'],['en','English'],['id','Indonesia']].map(([l,n])=>`<a href="${H(route,l)}" ${l===lang?'aria-current="true"':''}>${n}</a>`).join('')}</div><p class="menu-motto eyebrow">THE HAGUE ↔ JAKARTA</p><button class="theme-toggle menu-theme">◐ ${L('Light / dark','Terang / gelap','Licht / donker')}</button><button class="motion-toggle">${L('Motion: on','Animasi: aktif','Animatie: aan')}</button></aside></div></dialog>`;}
function footer(){return `<footer class="editorial-footer"><div class="footer-base"><a class="wordmark" data-locale="${lang.toUpperCase()}" href="${H('')}">EGGAN<small>NACHSON SILUETA</small></a><nav>${link('work',U('navWork'))}${link('creative-work',L('Creative','Kreatif','Creatief'))}${link('data-modeling',L('Data Modeling','Data Modeling','Datamodellering'))}${link('research',U('navResearch'))}${link('education',L('About','Tentang','Over'))}${link('documents',L('Documents','Dokumen','Documenten'))}${link('contact',U('navContact'))}</nav><p>© 2026 · THE HAGUE ↔ JAKARTA <i class="dot"></i></p><button class="motion-toggle">Motion: on</button><a href="#top" aria-label="Back to top">↑</a></div></footer>`;}
const skills=()=>`<div class="skills-grid">${Object.entries(D.SKILLS).map(([k,v])=>`<article class="reveal">${tag(U('skill'+k[0].toUpperCase()+k.slice(1)))}<ul>${v.map(x=>`<li>${E(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></article>`).join('')}</div>`;
function project(p,i){return `<article class="work-strip reveal"><div class="work-strip-copy">${tag(p.num)}<h2>${link('work/'+p.slug,E(p.name),'plain-link')}</h2><p>${projectSubtitle(i)}</p><a class="strip-live" href="${p.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${L('Open the live site','Buka situsnya langsung','Bekijk de live site')} <b>↗</b></a></div><a class="work-strip-image" href="${H('work/'+p.slug)}" aria-label="${E(p.name)}">${img('assets/work/'+p.dir+'/'+p.thumb,p.name,'',i===0)}</a><a class="work-strip-arrow" href="${H('work/'+p.slug)}" aria-label="${E(p.name)}">→</a></article>`;}
function projectSubtitle(i){return [L('Image and video creation<br>in one production platform.','Kreasi gambar dan video<br>dalam satu platform produksi.','Beeld- en videocreatie<br>in één productieplatform.'),L('Personalized learning,<br>built as a system.','Belajar personal,<br>dibangun sebagai sistem.','Persoonlijk leren,<br>gebouwd als een systeem.'),L('Food resilience,<br>made visible.','Ketahanan pangan,<br>terlihat melalui data.','Voedselzekerheid,<br>zichtbaar gemaakt.')][i];}
function planes(){return `<div class="paper-planes" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>`;}
function gallerySculpture(home=false){const panels=home?[['assets/showcase-mine/3-woman-cap.webp','cap',0],['assets/showcase-mine/3-woman-cap.webp','cap',0],['assets/showcase-mine/build-a-brand-4k.webp','brand',1],['assets/showcase-mine/3-woman-cap.webp','direction',0],['assets/covers/ideas-poster.jpg','',null]]:[[D.SHOWCASE[38].poster.slice(1),'',38],['assets/showcase-mine/build-a-brand-4k.webp','brand',1],['assets/showcase-mine/3-woman-cap.webp','cap',0],[D.SHOWCASE[43].poster.slice(1),'',43],[D.SHOWCASE[72].poster.slice(1),'',72]];return `<div class="gallery-sculpture ${home?'home-sculpture':''}">${panels.map(([src,cls,n],i)=>`<a class="sculpture-panel ${cls}" href="${H(n===null?'work':'creative-work/'+String(n+1).padStart(3,'0'))}" style="--i:${i}" aria-label="${n===null?'Explore work':mediaName(D.SHOWCASE[n],n)}"><div class="sculpture-image">${img(src,n===null?'Artwork from supplied visual reference':mediaName(D.SHOWCASE[n],n))}</div>${home&&i===2?`<span class="poster-title"><i class="red-line"></i>Ideas<br>that<br>move<br>people.</span>`:''}${home&&i===3?`<span class="poster-direction">ART<br>DIRECTION<br>BRAND<br>EXPERIENCES<br>AND<br>BEYOND.</span>`:''}</a>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function researchArt(i){return 'assets/covers/research-'+['network','city','fields','reef'][i]+'.jpg';}
function researchTitle(i){return [L('Strategic Intelligence Foresight<br>on Ransomware Threats','Foresight Intelijen Strategis<br>Ancaman Ransomware','Strategische Foresight<br>van Ransomwaredreigingen'),L('Digital Policy Bundles and<br>Food-System Resilience','Kebijakan Digital dan<br>Ketahanan Sistem Pangan','Digitaal Beleid en<br>Voedselsysteemweerbaarheid'),L('Smart Monitoring Food<br>System Resilience','Monitoring Cerdas<br>Ketahanan Sistem Pangan','Slimme Monitoring van<br>Voedselsysteemweerbaarheid'),'Reef to Welfare'][i];}
function researchSummary(i){return [L('Analyzing the escalation patterns of AI-powered ransomware attacks against state-owned banks in Indonesia and early prevention strategies for 2025–2029.','Menganalisis pola eskalasi serangan ransomware berbasis AI terhadap bank BUMN dan strategi pencegahan 2025–2029.','Analyse van AI-ransomware tegen Indonesische staatsbanken en preventiestrategieën voor 2025–2029.'),L('Exploring integrated digital policy approaches to strengthen food-system resilience in Indonesia.','Menjelajahi pendekatan kebijakan digital terpadu untuk memperkuat ketahanan pangan Indonesia.','Geïntegreerd digitaal beleid voor sterkere voedselsystemen in Indonesië.'),L('A proposal for data-driven monitoring of food system resilience using remote sensing and AI analytics.','Proposal monitoring ketahanan sistem pangan berbasis data, penginderaan jauh, dan analitik AI.','Een voorstel voor datagedreven monitoring met remote sensing en AI.'),L('Examining the link between marine ecosystem health and community welfare in Indonesia.','Mengkaji hubungan kesehatan ekosistem laut dan kesejahteraan masyarakat Indonesia.','Onderzoek naar mariene ecosystemen en het welzijn van gemeenschappen in Indonesië.')][i];}

function leadRow(x,i,small=false){return `<a href="${H('leadership/'+SL[i])}" class="lead-row reveal ${small?'compact':''}"><span class="row-number">${pad(i+1)}</span><div><h3>${E(x.org)}</h3><p>${E(T(x.role))}</p></div>${small?'':fold(['ICCN','INDONESIA\nMENGGLOBAL','UNESCO\n& UNDP','TIMUR\nGROWTH 2'][i]||x.org,pad(i+1))}<span class="arrow">↗</span></a>`;}
function researchRow(r,i){return `<a class="research-row reveal" data-status="${['published','ongoing','proposal','submitted'][i]}" href="${H('research/'+r.slug)}">${img(i===0?'assets/research/jurnal/jurnal-01.jpg':researchArt(i),r.title,'research-thumb')}<div><h3>${researchTitle(i)}</h3><p class="meta">${E(T(r.badge))} · ${r.pages} ${L('pages','halaman','pagina’s')}</p><p class="research-summary">${researchSummary(i)}</p></div><span class="read-paper">${U('openReader')} ↗</span></a>`;}

function productCover(i) {
 const p=D.PROJECTS[i];
 const headlines=[L('Create.<br>Inspire.<br>Make impact.','Berkreasi.<br>Inspirasi.<br>Beri dampak.','Creëer.<br>Inspireer.<br>Maak impact.'),L('Just<br>learn it.','Belajar.<br>Lebih jauh.','Blijf<br>leren.'),L('Stronger<br>communities.<br>Better data.','Komunitas kuat.<br>Data yang<br>bermakna.','Sterkere<br>gemeenschappen.<br>Betere data.')];
 const topics=[['IMAGE','VIDEO','VOICE'],['LEARN','PRACTICE','GROW'],['FOOD','PEOPLE','INSIGHT']];
 return `<div class="project-cover cover-${p.dir}"><div class="cover-topline"><span>${['CAP / CREATIVE AI PARTNER','MATCHUPSKILLS','LUMBUNG JAKUT'][i]}</span><span>${pad(i+1)} /</span></div><div class="cover-headline">${headlines[i]}</div><div class="cover-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="cover-screen"><div class="cover-screen-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>${p.name}</span></div>${img('assets/work/'+p.dir+'/'+p.thumb,p.name+' — '+L('original product interface','antarmuka produk asli','originele productinterface'))}</div><div class="cover-bottomline">${topics[i].map(t=>`<span>${t}</span>`).join('')}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div>`;
}
function introduction(){return `<section class="home-introduction" aria-labelledby="intro-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDONESIA → NETHERLANDS<br>AI PRODUCT · CREATIVE · RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT</p><h2 id="intro-heading">${L('AI products, data<br>and creative work.','Produk AI, data,<br>dan karya kreatif.','AI-producten, data<br>en creatief werk.')}</h2><i class="red-line"></i></div><div class="introduction-body"><p>${E(U('heroSub'))}</p><div class="introduction-actions">${link('work',L('Explore my work','Jelajahi karya saya','Ontdek mijn werk'),'intro-action primary')}${link('contact',L('Let’s connect','Mari terhubung','Laten we kennismaken'),'intro-action')}${link('documents',L('CV & Documents','CV & Dokumen','CV & Documenten'),'intro-action')}</div></div></section>`;}
function railControls(id,total){return `<div class="rail-controls"><p class="rail-hint">${L('Drag or swipe to explore · Click a card to open','Geser untuk menjelajahi · Klik kartu untuk membuka','Sleep of veeg om te ontdekken · Klik om te openen')}</p><div class="rail-pagination"><span class="rail-count" aria-live="polite">01 / ${pad(total)}</span><button data-rail-step="-1" aria-controls="${id}" aria-label="${L('Previous works','Karya sebelumnya','Vorige werken')}">←</button><button data-rail-step="1" aria-controls="${id}" aria-label="${L('Next works','Karya berikutnya','Volgende werken')}">→</button></div></div>`;}
function journeyCards(){const items=[{media:0},{project:0},{media:1},{project:1},{project:2}];return `<div class="journey-collection" data-carousel>${railControls('journey-cards',items.length)}<div class="journey-film artwork-rail" id="journey-cards" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="${L('Explore five selected works','Jelajahi lima karya pilihan','Ontdek vijf geselecteerde werken')}">${items.map((item,i)=>{const isProject=item.project!==undefined,p=D.PROJECTS[item.project],m=D.SHOWCASE[item.media],title=isProject?p.name: ['CAP — Creative direction','Build a Brand'][item.media];return `<a class="journey-card" href="${H(isProject?'work/'+p.slug:'creative-work/'+String(item.media+1).padStart(3,'0'))}" style="--i:${i}">${isProject?productCover(item.project):`<div class="journey-art">${img(m.file,title)}</div>`}<div class="journey-card-caption"><div><small>${pad(i+1)} / ${isProject?L('PRODUCT','PRODUK','PRODUCT'):L('CREATIVE','KREATIF','CREATIEF')}</small><strong>${E(title)}</strong></div><span class="card-open">${L('Open','Buka','Open')} ↗</span></div></a>`}).join('')}</div></div>`;}
function featuredCreative(){const selection=[129,0,131,1,133,38,134,137,72,130];return `<div class="featured-creative" data-carousel>${railControls('featured-works',selection.length)}<div class="creative-rail artwork-rail" id="featured-works" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="${L('Ten selected creative works','Sepuluh karya kreatif pilihan','Tien geselecteerde creatieve werken')}">${selection.map((n,i)=>{const m=D.SHOWCASE[n];return `<a class="featured-work" data-type="${m.type}" href="${H('creative-work/'+String(n+1).padStart(3,'0'))}" style="--art-ratio:${m.ratio.replace(':',' / ')}"><div class="featured-art">${mediaThumb(m,mediaName(m,n))}</div><div class="featured-caption"><span>${pad(i+1)} / ${mediaName(m,n)}</span><span>${m.type==='video'?L('Play film','Putar video','Speel video'):L('View work','Lihat karya','Bekijk werk')} ${m.type==='video'?'▷':'↗'}</span></div></a>`}).join('')}</div></div>`;}

function featuredData(){const items=dataTeaser({L});return `<div class="featured-creative featured-data" data-carousel>${railControls('featured-data-rail',items.length)}<div class="creative-rail artwork-rail data-rail" id="featured-data-rail" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="${L('Data models and AI agents','Model data dan agent AI','Datamodellen en AI-agents')}">${items.map((d,i)=>`<a class="featured-work data-card${d.art?' has-er':''}" href="${H(d.href)}"><div class="featured-art data-art">${d.art?`<div class="data-er">${d.art}</div>`:`<div class="data-agent"><span class="data-kind">${E(d.kicker)}</span><strong>${E(d.fact)}</strong><small>${E(d.factLabel)}</small><p>${E(d.tag)}</p></div>`}<div class="data-label"><span class="data-kind">${E(d.kind)} · ${E(d.kicker)}</span><h3>${E(d.title)}</h3>${d.art?`<p><b>${E(d.fact)}</b> ${E(d.factLabel)}</p>`:''}</div></div><div class="featured-caption"><span>${pad(i+1)} / ${E(d.title)}</span><span>${L('Open','Buka','Open')} ↗</span></div></a>`).join('')}</div></div>`;}
function home(){return `<section class="opening-scroll" id="opening"><div class="opening-pin"><div class="opening-sky"></div><div class="opening-portrait">${img('assets/profile-nobg.png','Eggan Nachson Silueta','',true)}</div><div class="opening-paper paper-left"></div><div class="opening-paper paper-right"></div><div class="opening-copy"><h1><span class="desktop-name">EGGAN<br>NACHSON<br>SILUETA</span><span class="mobile-name">${L("I build<br>AI products<br>people use.","Saya membangun<br>produk AI<br>yang dipakai orang.","Ik bouw<br>AI-producten<br>die mensen gebruiken.")}</span></h1><p class="eyebrow"><span class="desktop-name">AI PRODUCT<br>DATA &amp; ANALYTICS<br>CREATIVE DIRECTION</span><span class="mobile-name">${L("AI PRODUCT<br>DATA<br>CREATIVE","PRODUK AI<br>DATA<br>KREATIF","AI-PRODUCT<br>DATA<br>CREATIEF")}</span></p></div><span class="opening-side eyebrow">FROM JAKARTA,<br>BASED IN<br>THE HAGUE</span><div class="opening-bottom"><a class="mobile-explore" href="${H('work')}"><span>↗</span>${L('Explore work','Jelajahi karya','Ontdek werk')}</a><span><i class="red-line"></i>01 — ${L('About me','Tentang saya','Over mij')}</span><a href="#journey">${L('SCROLL<br>TO EXPLORE','SCROLL<br>UNTUK JELAJAHI','SCROLL<br>OM TE ONTDEKKEN')}<b>↓</b></a></div></div></section>${introduction()}<section class="journey-scroll" id="journey"><div class="journey-pin"><div class="journey-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED<br>PROJECTS,<br>ALL LIVE.</p><h2>${L('Selected work.','Karya pilihan.','Geselecteerd werk.')}</h2><i class="red-line"></i></div>${journeyCards()}<div class="chapter-label">02 — ${L('Selected projects','Proyek pilihan','Geselecteerde projecten')}</div></div></section><section class="systems-stage" id="work"><div class="systems-heading"><h2>${L('Systems<br>I’ve built.','Sistem yang<br>saya bangun.','Systemen<br>die ik bouw.')}</h2><p>${L('Three products I designed<br>and run, from the first idea<br>to the live site.','Tiga produk yang saya rancang<br>dan jalankan, dari ide pertama<br>sampai situs live.','Drie producten die ik ontwierp<br>en run, van het eerste idee<br>tot de live site.')}</p></div><div class="product-monuments">${D.PROJECTS.map((p,i)=>`<article class="product-monument" style="--i:${i}"><a class="monument-link" href="${H('work/'+p.slug)}" aria-label="${E(p.name)}"></a><div class="monument-title"><span>${p.name}</span><small>${E(T(p.tag))}</small></div>${productCover(i)}<div class="monument-caption"><p>${projectSubtitle(i)}</p><a class="monument-live" href="${p.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="${L('Open the live site','Buka situsnya langsung','Bekijk de live site')}: ${E(p.name)}">${L('Live site','Situs asli','Live site')} <b>↗</b></a></div></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="stage-floor"></div><div class="chapter-label">03 — ${L('Live products','Produk live','Live producten')}</div></section><section class="creative-stage data-stage" id="data"><h2 aria-label="Data">DATA</h2>${featuredData()}<div class="creative-stage-bottom">${link('data-modeling',L('See more — data modeling &amp; AI agents','Lihat semua — data modeling &amp; agent AI','Bekijk alles — datamodellering &amp; AI-agents'))}<p class="eyebrow">DATA MODELS, AI AGENTS<br>AND ANALYTICS.</p></div></section><section class="creative-stage"><h2 aria-label="Creative">CREATIVE</h2>${featuredCreative()}<div class="creative-stage-bottom">${link('creative-work',L('See more — all creative work','Lihat semua karya kreatif','Bekijk alle creatieve werken'))}<p class="eyebrow">CAMPAIGN IMAGES,<br>VIDEO ADS AND PROMOS.</p></div></section><section class="home-research"><div class="home-research-heading"><h2>${L('My<br>research.','Riset<br>saya.','Mijn<br>onderzoek.')}</h2><p>${L('Papers and proposals on<br>cybersecurity, digital policy<br>and food systems.','Makalah dan proposal tentang<br>keamanan siber, kebijakan digital,<br>dan sistem pangan.','Papers en voorstellen over<br>cybersecurity, digitaal beleid<br>en voedselsystemen.')}</p></div><div class="research-folds">${D.RESEARCH.map((r,i)=>`<a href="${H('research/'+r.slug)}" class="research-leaf"><small>${pad(i+1)}</small><h3>${E([L('Ransomware & Strategic Foresight','Ransomware & Foresight Strategis','Ransomware & Strategische Foresight'),L('Digital Policy & Food Resilience','Kebijakan Digital & Ketahanan Pangan','Digitaal Beleid & Voedselzekerheid'),L('Smart Monitoring Food Systems','Monitoring Cerdas Sistem Pangan','Slimme Monitoring Voedselsystemen'),'Reef to Welfare'][i])}</h3>${img(researchArt(i),r.title)}<p>${E(T(r.badge))} · ${r.pages} ${L('pages','halaman','pagina’s')}</p></a>`).join('')}</div><div class="research-links">${link('research',U('navResearch'))}${link('documents',L('CV & Documents','CV & Dokumen','CV & Documenten'))}<span class="eyebrow">PUBLISHED, ONGOING<br>AND SUBMITTED.</span></div></section><section class="people-stage"><div class="people-sky"></div><div class="people-paper"></div><div class="people-copy"><h2>${L('About<br>me.','Tentang<br>saya.','Over<br>mij.')}</h2><i class="red-line"></i><p>${L('Indonesian, living in The Hague.<br>Four years in banking,<br>now building AI products<br>and studying data.','Orang Indonesia, tinggal di Den Haag.<br>Empat tahun di perbankan,<br>kini membangun produk AI<br>dan belajar data.','Indonesiër, woont in Den Haag.<br>Vier jaar in het bankwezen,<br>nu bouw ik AI-producten<br>en studeer ik data.')}</p>${link('education',L('Experience &amp; education','Pengalaman &amp; pendidikan','Ervaring &amp; opleiding'))}</div>${img('assets/profile-nobg.png','Eggan Nachson Silueta','people-portrait')}<span class="people-note">The Hague<br>↔<br>Jakarta</span></section><section class="talk-strip"><h2>${L('Let’s talk.','Mari bicara.','Laten we praten.')}</h2><a href="mailto:${D.CONTACT.email}"><i class="red-line"></i>${D.CONTACT.email} →</a></section>`;}
function work(){return `<header class="work-index-intro"><h1>${L('Selected<br>work.','Karya<br>pilihan.','Geselecteerd<br>werk.')}</h1><p class="eyebrow">AI PRODUCTS.<br>DATA.<br>CREATIVE.</p><i class="red-line"></i><span class="work-index-note">${L("Ideas into<br>real products<br>and people’s<br>lives.","Ide menjadi<br>produk nyata<br>dan kehidupan<br>manusia.","Ideeën voor<br>echte producten<br>en levens van<br>mensen.")}</span></header><section class="work-index">${D.PROJECTS.map(project).join('')}</section><div class="work-bottom">${link('creative-work',L('Creative archive','Arsip kreatif','Creatief archief'))}<a href="#services" class="text-link">${L('Services','Layanan','Diensten')} →</a><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCTS I DESIGN<br>AND RUN.</span></div><section class="section services" id="services"><div class="section-head"><h2>${U('servicesTitle')}</h2></div><div class="four-up">${[L('Digital products','Produk digital','Digitale producten'),L('AI integration','Integrasi AI','AI-integratie'),L('Business & data','Bisnis & data','Business & data'),L('Creative direction','Arahan kreatif','Creatieve regie')].map((x,i)=>`<article>${tag(pad(i+1))}<h3>${x}</h3><p>${[L('From idea to useful, working software.','Dari ide menjadi perangkat lunak yang berguna.','Van idee naar bruikbare software.'),L('Intelligent workflows for real needs.','Alur kerja cerdas untuk kebutuhan nyata.','Intelligente workflows voor echte behoeften.'),L('Clear systems for better decisions.','Sistem yang jelas untuk keputusan lebih baik.','Heldere systemen voor betere beslissingen.'),L('Images and video ads I directed.','Gambar dan iklan video yang saya arahkan.','Beelden en videoads die ik regisseerde.')][i]}</p></article>`).join('')}</div></section>`;}
function projectDetail(p){const i=D.PROJECTS.indexOf(p);const shots=[p.thumb,...fs.readdirSync(path.join(ROOT,'assets/work',p.dir)).filter(x=>/\.(jpg|png|webp)$/.test(x)&&x!==p.thumb)];const shotPath=f=>'assets/work/'+p.dir+'/'+f;return `<div class="detail-paper">${planes()}<div class="breadcrumbs">${link('work',U('navWork'))}<span>${E(p.name)}</span></div><header class="project-intro"><h1>${E(p.name)}<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1><p>${projectSubtitle(i)}</p><a class="live-site-button" href="${p.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${L('Open the live site','Buka situsnya langsung','Bekijk de live site')} <b>↗</b></a><span class="eyebrow">FROM IDEA<br>TO LIVE SITE.</span></header><section class="project-gallery" aria-label="${E(p.name)} screenshots"><a class="project-slide zoomable" href="${A(shotPath(shots[0]))}" data-caption="${E(p.name)}"><img id="project-main-image" src="${A(shotPath(shots[0]))}" alt="${E(p.name)} — ${shotLabel(shots[0])}" fetchpriority="high"></a><div class="project-gallery-controls"><div class="project-thumbnails">${shots.map((f,j)=>`<button data-slide="${j}" data-src="${A(shotPath(f))}" data-label="${E(p.name+' — '+shotLabel(f))}" aria-label="${L('Screenshot','Tangkapan layar','Schermafbeelding')} ${j+1}" aria-pressed="${j===0}">${img(shotPath(f),p.name+' '+pad(j+1))}</button>`).join('')}</div><div><span id="slide-count" role="status">01 / ${pad(shots.length)}</span><div class="slide-arrows"><button data-slide-step="-1" aria-label="Previous screenshot">←</button><button data-slide-step="1" aria-label="Next screenshot">→</button></div></div></div></section><div class="project-overview ${i===0?'cap-overview':''}">${(i===0?[[L('Overview','Ringkasan','Overzicht'),L('From ideas to production-ready visuals.','Dari ide ke visual siap produksi.','Van idee naar productieklare beelden.')],[L('AI orchestration','Orkestrasi AI','AI-orkestratie'),L('Image, video, voice and avatars in one workflow.','Gambar, video, suara, dan avatar dalam satu alur.','Beeld, video, stem en avatars in één workflow.')],[L('Credit system','Sistem kredit','Kredietsysteem'),L('Flexible creation for individuals and teams.','Kreasi fleksibel untuk individu dan tim.','Flexibele creatie voor individuen en teams.')],[L('Results','Hasil','Resultaten'),L('More content. More possibilities.','Lebih banyak konten. Lebih banyak kemungkinan.','Meer content. Meer mogelijkheden.')]]:i===1?[[L('Learning pipeline','Alur belajar','Leerproces'),L('From materials to interactive experience.','Dari materi menjadi pengalaman interaktif.','Van materiaal naar interactieve ervaring.')],[L('Exam simulations','Simulasi ujian','Examensimulaties'),L('Practice with real scenarios and instant feedback.','Berlatih dengan skenario nyata dan umpan balik langsung.','Oefen met echte scenario’s en directe feedback.')],[L('Reports','Laporan','Rapporten'),L('Track progress and build future opportunities.','Pantau kemajuan dan bangun peluang masa depan.','Volg vooruitgang en bouw aan toekomstige kansen.')]]:[[L('Context','Konteks','Context'),L('Understanding food security challenges in North Jakarta.','Memahami tantangan ketahanan pangan Jakarta Utara.','Voedselzekerheidsvraagstukken in Noord-Jakarta begrijpen.')],[L('Monitoring system','Sistem monitoring','Monitoringsysteem'),L('Track supply, distribution and regional potential.','Pantau pasokan, distribusi, dan potensi wilayah.','Volg aanvoer, distributie en regionaal potentieel.')],[L('Policy reporting','Laporan kebijakan','Beleidsrapportage'),L('Turn data into stronger, more resilient communities.','Ubah data menjadi komunitas yang lebih tangguh.','Data omzetten in veerkrachtigere gemeenschappen.')]]).map(([h,t])=>`<div><h3>${h}</h3><p>${t}</p></div>`).join('')}<a class="text-link" href="${p.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${U('visitSite')} →</a></div><details class="case-notes"><summary>${L('Read the complete project story','Baca cerita proyek lengkap','Lees het volledige projectverhaal')} <span>+</span></summary><ol class="numbered-list">${T(p.highlights).map((x,j)=>`<li><span>${pad(j+1)}</span><p>${E(x)}</p></li>`).join('')}</ol></details><div class="next-work">${tag(L('NEXT PROJECT','PROYEK BERIKUTNYA','VOLGEND PROJECT'))}${link('work/'+D.PROJECTS[(i+1)%3].slug,D.PROJECTS[(i+1)%3].name)}</div></div>`;}
function education(){return `<section class="about-reference"><div class="about-reference-copy"><h1>${L('Experience<br>&amp; education.','Pengalaman<br>&amp; pendidikan.','Ervaring<br>&amp; opleiding.')}</h1><i class="red-line"></i><p>${L('AI product, creative direction,<br>and relationship management.','Produk AI, arahan kreatif,<br>dan pengelolaan hubungan.','AI-producten, creatieve regie<br>en relatiemanagement.')}</p><span class="eyebrow">AI PRODUCT<br>DATA<br>CREATIVE<br>BANKING</span></div><div class="about-reference-portrait">${img('assets/profile-nobg.png','Eggan Nachson Silueta','',true)}<span class="portrait-note">Hi,<br>I’m<br>Eggan</span></div><span class="about-reference-note eyebrow">STUDYING<br>DATA-DRIVEN<br>BUSINESS IN<br>THE HAGUE.<i class="red-line"></i></span></section><section class="experience-reference section"><div class="experience-reference-copy"><h2>${L('Experience','Pengalaman','Ervaring')}</h2><span class="eyebrow">WORK HISTORY,<br>NEWEST FIRST.</span><div class="experience-list">${D.EXPERIENCE.map((x,i)=>`<details class="experience-item"><summary><span class="experience-period">${E(x.period+T(x.periodSuffix))}</span><span class="experience-position"><strong>${['MatchupSkills','Universitas Indonesia','Bank BRI'][i]}</strong><span>${[L('AI Product Lead','AI Product Lead','AI Product Lead'),L('AI & Data Research Assistant','Asisten Riset AI & Data','AI & Data Research Assistant'),L('Relationship Manager','Relationship Manager','Relatiemanager')][i]}</span></summary><div class="experience-extra"><ul>${T(x.bullets).map(b=>`<li>${E(b).replace('{{RESEARCH_LINK}}',`<a href="${H('research')}">${L('national research proposal','proposal riset nasional','nationaal onderzoeksvoorstel')}</a>`)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>${x.stack?chips(x.stack):''}</div></details>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="experience-paper">${planes()}<p class="eyebrow">DEGREES,<br>COURSES<br>AND AWARDS.<i class="red-line"></i></p></div></section><section class="section education-reference"><div class="section-head"><h2>${L('Education','Pendidikan','Opleiding')}</h2><p class="eyebrow">FOUR DEGREES,<br>TWO COUNTRIES.</p></div><div class="education-grid">${D.EDUCATION.map((e,i)=>`<article><small>${pad(i+1)}</small><h3>${E(e.school)}</h3><p>${E(T(e.degree)).split(' · ')[0]}</p><span class="education-year">${E(e.period)}${T(e.periodSuffix)?' · '+E(T(e.periodSuffix)):''}</span>${img('assets/covers/campus-'+['hague','ui','swadharma','ui-diploma'][i]+'.jpg',e.school+' campus')}</article>`).join('')}</div><p class="photo-credit">${L('Photos','Foto','Foto’s')}: OSeveno (CC BY-SA 3.0), Kaliper1, Ilham Kuniawan Gumilang (CC BY-SA 4.0) via Wikimedia Commons · ITB Swadharma</p></section><section class="section courses-reference"><div class="section-head"><h2>${L('Courses','Kursus','Cursussen')}</h2><p class="eyebrow">CERTIFIED<br>COURSES.</p></div><div class="course-grid">${D.COURSES.map((c,i)=>`<details><summary><small>${pad(i+1)}</small><h3>${['Product<br>Vision','Java<br>Database','Java<br>OOP','Android<br>with Kotlin','Linux<br>Cybersecurity','Power BI'][i]}</h3></summary><p>${E(T(c.name))}<br>${E(c.org)} · ${c.year}${c.score?'<br>'+E(c.score):''}</p></details>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="section achievements-reference"><div class="section-head"><h2>${L('Achievements','Pencapaian','Prestaties')}</h2><p class="eyebrow">AWARDS AND<br>RECOGNITION.</p></div><div class="three-up">${D.ACHIEVEMENTS.map((c,i)=>`<details><summary><small>${pad(i+1)}</small><h3>${[L('UI Hackathon<br>finalist','Finalis<br>UI Hackathon','UI Hackathon<br>finalist'),L('Indonesia Incubate<br>finalist','Finalis<br>Indonesia Incubate','Indonesia Incubate<br>finalist'),L('FEB Yarsi<br>business competition winner','Juara kompetisi bisnis<br>FEB Yarsi','Winnaar bedrijfscompetitie<br>FEB Yarsi')][i]}</h3></summary><p>${E(T(c.title))}<br>${E(T(c.desc))}</p></details>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="section skills-reference"><div class="section-head"><h2>${L('Skills','Keahlian','Vaardigheden')}</h2><p class="eyebrow">TOOLS AND METHODS<br>I USE DAILY.</p></div>${skills()}</section><section class="about-cv">${planes()}${link('documents',L('CV & documents','CV & dokumen','CV & documenten'),'display text-link')}<p class="eyebrow">MORE ABOUT<br>MY BACKGROUND,<br>EXPERIENCE, AND WORK.</p></section>`;}

function leadership(){return `<div class="split-intro">${heads(U('leadershipPageEyebrow'),L('People.<br>Purpose.<br><em>Progress.</em>','Manusia.<br>Tujuan.<br><em>Kemajuan.</em>','Mensen.<br>Ambitie.<br><em>Vooruitgang.</em>'),L('Communities create opportunities. Together we build a brighter tomorrow.','Komunitas membuka kesempatan. Bersama, kita membangun masa depan yang lebih baik.','Gemeenschappen creëren kansen. Samen bouwen we aan een betere toekomst.'))}${fold('DIFFERENT\nPERSPECTIVES.\nA SHARED\nCOMMITMENT.','05','intro-fold')}</div><section class="section leadership-index">${D.LEADERSHIP.slice(0,4).map((x,i)=>leadRow(x,i)).join('')}</section>`+sect(L('Other involvements','Keterlibatan lainnya','Andere betrokkenheid'),`<div class="other-lead">${D.LEADERSHIP.slice(4).map((x,i)=>leadRow(x,i+4,true)).join('')}</div>`)+`<section class="section field-cover"><div class="section-head"><h2>${U('galleryTitle')}</h2>${tag('07 / FIELD NOTES')}</div><a href="${H('leadership/field-notes')}" aria-label="${E(U('galleryTitle'))}">${fold('MOMENTS\nFROM THE FIELD','07')}<span class="field-caption">${L('Open the photo archive','Buka arsip foto','Open het fotoarchief')} ↗</span></a></section>`;}
function leadershipDetail(x,i){const pics=(x.images||[x.img]).filter(Boolean).filter(f=>f!=='biru-muda.jpg');return `<div class="breadcrumbs">${link('leadership',U('navLeadership'))}<span>${pad(i+1)} / 10</span></div>`+heads(x.year+T(x.yearSuffix),E(x.org),E(T(x.role)))+`<section class="section leadership-detail"><div>${fold(['ICCN','INDONESIA\nMENGGLOBAL','UNESCO\n& UNDP','TIMUR\nGROWTH 2'][i]||x.org,pad(i+1))}</div><div><p class="body-large">${E(T(x.desc))}</p>${x.stat?`<strong class="stat">${E(x.stat)}</strong><p class="meta">${E(T(x.statLabel))}</p>`:''}${x.link?`<a class="text-link" href="${x.link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${U('viewOrg')} ↗</a>`:''}</div></section>`+sect(L('From the archive','Dari arsip kegiatan','Uit het archief'),pics.length?`<div class="archive-grid">${pics.map((p,n)=>`<figure class="reveal"><a class="zoomable" data-caption="${E(x.org+' — '+pad(n+1))}" href="${A('assets/leadership/'+p)}">${img('assets/leadership/'+p,x.org+' — '+pad(n+1))}</a><figcaption>${pad(n+1)} / ${E(x.org)}</figcaption></figure>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="archive-empty">${tag('DOCUMENTATION')}<h3>${L('A story beyond the frame.','Cerita di balik karya.','Een verhaal buiten beeld.')}</h3><p>${L('The role and contribution are documented above. Event photographs will be added when the original archive is available.','Peran dan kontribusi tercantum di atas. Foto kegiatan akan ditambahkan ketika arsip aslinya tersedia.','Rol en bijdrage staan hierboven. Evenementfoto’s volgen wanneer het originele archief beschikbaar is.')}</p></div>`)+`<div class="section">${link('leadership/'+SL[(i+1)%10],D.LEADERSHIP[(i+1)%10].org,'display text-link')}</div>`;}
function fieldNotes(){return `<div class="breadcrumbs">${link('leadership',U('navLeadership'))}</div>`+heads('07 / FIELD NOTES',U('galleryTitle'),E(U('galleryNote')))+`<section class="section archive-grid">${D.GALLERY.map((g,i)=>i===0?`<article class="archive-empty">${tag('01 / CRITICAL GROUNDS')}<h3>${L('Original photo archive','Arsip foto asli','Origineel fotoarchief')}</h3><p>${L('Photograph awaiting an original archive replacement.','Foto menunggu pengganti dari arsip asli.','Foto wacht op vervanging uit het originele archief.')}</p></article>`:`<figure class="reveal"><a class="zoomable" href="${A('assets/gallery/'+g.img)}" data-caption="${E(T(g.caption))}">${img('assets/gallery/'+g.img,T(g.caption))}</a><figcaption>${pad(i+1)} / ${E(T(g.caption))}</figcaption></figure>`).join('')}</section>`;}
const SHOW_ORDER=()=>{const all=D.SHOWCASE.map((m,i)=>[m,i]);return [...all.filter(([m])=>m.featured),...all.filter(([m])=>!m.featured)];};
function mediaName(s,i){if(s.title)return E(T(s.title));return `${s.type==='video'?L('Motion','Video','Video'):L('Visual','Visual','Beeld')} ${String(i+1).padStart(3,'0')}`;}
function creative(){return `<section class="creative-index-hero">${planes()}<h1>${L('Creative<br>work.','Karya<br>kreatif.','Creatief<br>werk.')}</h1><i class="red-line"></i><p>${L('Images and video ads I directed.','Gambar dan iklan video yang saya arahkan.','Beelden en videoads die ik regisseerde.')}</p><span class="eyebrow creative-side">DIRECTED<br>FOR BRANDS.</span>${gallerySculpture()}</section><section class="section gallery-section"><div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Media filters"><div>${['all','image','video'].map((f,i)=>`<button class="filter ${i===0?'active':''}" data-filter="${f}" aria-pressed="${i===0}">${U('showcaseFilter'+{all:'All',image:'Image',video:'Video'}[f])}<sup>${f==='all'?D.SHOWCASE.length:D.SHOWCASE.filter(s=>s.type===f).length}</sup></button>`).join('')}</div><span id="result-count" role="status">${D.SHOWCASE.length} ${L('works','karya','werken')}</span></div><div class="media-grid">${SHOW_ORDER().map(([m,i])=>`<a id="media-${i+1}" class="media-card" data-type="${m.type}" href="${H('creative-work/'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'))}" style="--aspect:${m.ratio.replace(':',' / ')}">${mediaThumb(m,mediaName(m,i))}<div><span>${mediaName(m,i)}</span><span>${m.type==='video'?'▶':'↗'}</span></div></a>`).join('')}</div><button class="load-more" id="load-more">${L('Load more','Muat lebih banyak','Meer laden')} →</button><p class="meta">${L('AI-assisted creative production by Creative AI Partner.','Produksi kreatif berbantuan AI oleh Creative AI Partner.','AI-ondersteunde creatieve productie door Creative AI Partner.')}</p></section>`;}
function mediaDetail(s,i){return `<section class="section media-detail"><h1 class="sr-only">${mediaName(s,i)}</h1><div class="media-toolbar">${link('creative-work',L('Back to archive','Kembali ke arsip','Terug naar archief'))}${tag(`${pad(i+1)} / ${D.SHOWCASE.length} · ${mediaName(s,i)}`)}</div><div class="media-stage">${s.type==='video'?`<video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="${A(s.poster)}" aria-label="${mediaName(s,i)}"><source src="${A(s.file)}" type="video/mp4">${L('Your browser cannot play this video.','Browser tidak dapat memutar video ini.','Je browser kan deze video niet afspelen.')}</video>`:`<a class="zoomable" href="${A(s.file)}" data-caption="${mediaName(s,i)}">${img(s.file,mediaName(s,i),'',true)}</a>`}</div><div class="media-toolbar">${link('creative-work/'+String((i+D.SHOWCASE.length-1)%D.SHOWCASE.length+1).padStart(3,'0'),'← '+L('Previous','Sebelumnya','Vorige'))}<span>CREATIVE AI PARTNER · ${E(s.ratio)}</span>${link('creative-work/'+String((i+1)%D.SHOWCASE.length+1).padStart(3,'0'),L('Next','Berikutnya','Volgende'))}</div><p class="meta">${L('AI-assisted creative sample.','Contoh produksi kreatif berbantuan AI.','AI-ondersteund creatief voorbeeld.')}</p></section>`;}
function research(){return `<section class="blue-paper-banner">${planes()}<h1>${L('Research.','Riset.','Onderzoek.')}</h1><i class="red-line"></i><p class="eyebrow">PAPERS<br>AND PROPOSALS.</p></section><section class="research-library"><div class="research-filters" role="group" aria-label="Research status">${['all','published','ongoing','proposal','submitted'].map((f,i)=>`<button data-research-filter="${f}" aria-pressed="${i===0}">${[L('All','Semua','Alles'),L('Published','Terbit','Gepubliceerd'),L('Ongoing','Berjalan','Lopend'),L('Proposal','Proposal','Voorstel'),L('Submitted','Diajukan','Ingediend')][i]}</button>`).join('')}<span id="research-count" role="status">4 ${L('works','riset','werken')}</span></div>${D.RESEARCH.map(researchRow).join('')}<p class="meta">4 ${L('works','riset','werken')} · 98 ${L('pages','halaman','pagina’s')}</p><p class="photo-credit">${L('Cover photos','Foto sampul','Omslagfoto’s')}: Masdestructive (CC BY-SA 3.0), Hariyono Suwardi (CC BY 4.0), Balkot Farm Jakarta, Akbar raf (CC BY-SA 4.0) via Wikimedia Commons</p></section>`;}
function reader(r){return `<div class="breadcrumbs">${link('research',U('navResearch'))}</div>`+heads(T(r.badge),E(r.title),E(T(r.abstract)),'reader-intro')+`<section class="section reader" data-slug="${r.slug}" data-pages="${r.pages}" data-prefix="${A('assets/research/'+r.slug+'/'+r.slug+'-')}"><p class="meta">${E(T(r.meta))}<br>${E(r.authors)}</p><div class="reader-layout"><aside class="reader-thumbs" aria-label="${L('Page thumbnails','Thumbnail halaman','Paginavoorbeelden')}">${Array.from({length:r.pages},(_,i)=>`<button data-page="${i+1}" aria-label="${L('Page','Halaman','Pagina')} ${i+1}">${img('assets/research/'+r.slug+'/'+r.slug+'-'+pad(i+1)+'.jpg','')}<span>${i+1}</span></button>`).join('')}</aside><div class="reader-viewport">${img('assets/research/'+r.slug+'/'+r.slug+'-01.jpg',r.title+' — 1','reader-image',true)}</div></div><div class="reader-controls"><button data-page-step="-1" aria-label="${L('Previous page','Halaman sebelumnya','Vorige pagina')}">←</button><label>${L('Page','Halaman','Pagina')} <input class="page-input" type="number" min="1" max="${r.pages}" value="1"> / ${r.pages}</label><button data-page-step="1" aria-label="${L('Next page','Halaman berikutnya','Volgende pagina')}">→</button><button id="zoom-page">${L('Zoom','Perbesar','Zoom')} 100%</button><a id="reader-original" href="${A('assets/research/'+r.slug+'/'+r.slug+'-01.jpg')}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${L('Open page','Buka halaman','Open pagina')} ↗</a></div><p class="reader-status sr-only" role="status"></p><p class="meta">${L('Use ← → to change page. The reader remembers your position on this device.','Gunakan ← → untuk pindah halaman. Posisi baca tersimpan di perangkat ini.','Gebruik ← → om te bladeren. De lezer onthoudt je positie op dit apparaat.')}</p></section>`;}
function documents(){return `<section class="blue-paper-banner">${planes()}<h1>${L('CV &<br>documents.','CV &<br>dokumen.','CV &<br>documenten.')}</h1><i class="red-line"></i><p class="eyebrow">${L('ESSENTIAL DOCUMENTS<br>FOR A CLEARER CONVERSATION.','DOKUMEN PENTING<br>UNTUK PERCAKAPAN YANG LEBIH JELAS.','ESSENTIËLE DOCUMENTEN<br>VOOR EEN HELDER GESPREK.')}</p></section><section class="document-library"><div class="download-all"><a class="button" download href="${A('assets/credentials/eggan-credentials.zip')}">${U('documentsDownloadAll')} ↓</a></div>${D.DOCUMENTS.map((d,i)=>`<article class="document-row"><a class="document-thumb" href="${H('documents/'+['cv','bachelor','masters','thesis','certificates'][i])}">${img('assets/credentials/previews/'+['cv','bachelor','masters','thesis','certificates'][i]+'.jpg',T(d.label))}</a><div><h2>${E(i===3?L('Master thesis','Tesis magister','Masterscriptie'):T(d.label))}</h2><p>${E(T(d.note))}</p></div><div class="document-actions">${link('documents/'+['cv','bachelor','masters','thesis','certificates'][i],L('Preview','Pratinjau','Voorbeeld'))}<a href="${A('assets/credentials/'+(d.file||d.files[lang==='id'?'id':'en']))}" download>${L('Download','Unduh','Download')} ↓</a></div></article>`).join('')}<p class="meta">5 ${L('document groups','kelompok dokumen','documentgroepen')}</p></section>`;}
function docDetail(d,i){const key=['cv','bachelor','masters',lang==='id'?'thesis-id':'thesis-en','certificates'][i],meta=DP[key],file=meta.file;const prefix=k=>A('assets/credentials/pages/'+k+'/'+k+'-');return `<div class="document-preview-page">${planes()}<div class="breadcrumbs">${link('documents',L('Documents','Dokumen','Documenten'))}</div><header class="document-preview-heading"><h1>${E(i===3?L('Master thesis','Tesis magister','Masterscriptie'):T(d.label))}</h1><div>${d.files?`<div class="document-language-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Document language"><button data-document-language="en" aria-pressed="${lang!=='id'}">EN</button><button data-document-language="id" aria-pressed="${lang==='id'}">ID</button></div><label class="sr-only">${L('Document language','Bahasa dokumen','Documenttaal')}<select id="doc-language"><option value="${A('assets/credentials/'+d.files.en)}" data-prefix="${prefix('thesis-en')}" data-total="${DP['thesis-en'].pages}" ${lang!=='id'?'selected':''}>English</option><option value="${A('assets/credentials/'+d.files.id)}" data-prefix="${prefix('thesis-id')}" data-total="${DP['thesis-id'].pages}" ${lang==='id'?'selected':''}>Indonesia</option></select></label>`:''}<a class="text-link doc-preview" href="${A('assets/credentials/'+file)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${L('Open PDF','Buka PDF','Open PDF')} ↗</a><a class="button doc-download" href="${A('assets/credentials/'+file)}" download>${L('Download','Unduh','Download')} ↓</a></div></header><section class="document-reader" data-doc-prefix="${prefix(key)}" data-doc-total="${meta.pages}" data-doc-key="${key}" aria-label="${E(T(d.label))}"><div class="document-page-layout"><aside class="document-page-thumbs" aria-label="${L('Page thumbnails','Thumbnail halaman','Paginavoorbeelden')}">${Array.from({length:meta.pages},(_,j)=>`<button data-doc-page="${j+1}" aria-label="${L('Page','Halaman','Pagina')} ${j+1}" ${j===0?'aria-current="page"':''}>${img('assets/credentials/pages/'+key+'/'+key+'-'+pad(j+1)+'.jpg','')}<span>${j+1}</span></button>`).join('')}</aside><div class="document-page-viewport"><img class="document-page-image" src="${prefix(key)}01.jpg" alt="${E(T(d.label))} — 1" fetchpriority="high"></div></div><div class="document-page-controls"><button data-doc-step="-1" aria-label="${L('Previous page','Halaman sebelumnya','Vorige pagina')}" disabled>←</button><label><input id="document-page-number" type="number" min="1" max="${meta.pages}" value="1" aria-label="${L('Page number','Nomor halaman','Paginanummer')}"> / <span id="document-page-total">${meta.pages}</span></label><button data-doc-step="1" aria-label="${L('Next page','Halaman berikutnya','Volgende pagina')}">→</button><select id="document-fit" aria-label="${L('Page fit','Ukuran halaman','Pagina passend')} "><option value="page">${L('Fit page','Pas halaman','Passende pagina')}</option><option value="width">${L('Fit width','Pas lebar','Passende breedte')}</option></select><button data-doc-zoom="-1" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button data-doc-zoom="1" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button></div><p id="document-reader-status" class="sr-only" role="status"></p></section><noscript><p>${L('Use Open PDF above to read all pages.','Gunakan Buka PDF di atas untuk membaca semua halaman.','Gebruik Open PDF hierboven om alle pagina’s te lezen.')}</p></noscript></div>`;}

function contact(){return `<section class="contact-editorial">${planes()}<h1>${L('Let’s build<br>something useful.','Mari bangun<br>sesuatu yang berguna.','Laten we iets<br>bruikbaars bouwen.')}</h1><i class="red-line"></i><p>${L('Ideas become impact<br>when we work together.','Ide menjadi dampak<br>saat kita bekerja bersama.','Ideeën worden impact<br>wanneer we samenwerken.')}</p><div class="contact-lines"><div><small>Email</small><a href="mailto:${D.CONTACT.email}">${D.CONTACT.email}</a><button id="copy-email" data-email="${D.CONTACT.email}" aria-label="${L('Copy email','Salin email','Kopieer e-mail')}">⧉</button><span id="copy-status" role="status"></span></div>${[D.CONTACT.waIndonesia,D.CONTACT.waNetherlands].filter(Boolean).map(c=>`<a href="${c.link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><small>${E(T(c.label))}</small>${c.phone}</a>`).join('')}</div>${link('documents',L('CV & Documents','CV & Dokumen','CV & Documenten'))}<div class="contact-location">THE HAGUE ↔ JAKARTA<br><span class="eyebrow">OPEN TO DATA, AI<br>AND PRODUCT ROLES.</span></div></section>`;}
const catalog=[];function write(r,title,fn){route=r;let dest=target(r);base='../'.repeat(dest.split('/').length-1);const body=fn();const canonical='https://eggan.vercel.app/'+[lang==='nl'?'':lang,r].filter(Boolean).join('/');const html=`<!doctype html><html lang="${lang}" id="top"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>${E(title)} — Eggan Nachson Silueta</title><meta name="description" content="${E(U('eduPageBody'))}"><link rel="canonical" href="${canonical}">${['nl','en','id'].map(l=>`<link rel="alternate" hreflang="${l}" href="https://eggan.vercel.app/${[l==='nl'?'':l,r].filter(Boolean).join('/')}">`).join('')}<link rel="icon" href="${A('assets/favicon-32.png')}"><script>try{let t=localStorage.getItem('eggan-theme');document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t||'light';if(localStorage.getItem('eggan-motion')==='off'||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches)document.documentElement.dataset.motion='off'}catch(e){}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="${A('assets/site.css')}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${A('assets/revision.css')}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${A('assets/polish.css')}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${A('assets/data-modeling.css')}"><script defer src="${A('assets/site.js')}"></script><script defer src="${A('assets/revision.js')}"></script><script defer src="${A('assets/polish.js')}"></script>${r.startsWith('data-modeling')?`<script defer src="${A('assets/data-modeling.js')}"></script>`:''}</head><body data-route="${E(r)}">${nav()}<main id="main">${body}</main>${footer()}<dialog id="image-dialog" class="image-dialog" aria-label="${L('Image viewer','Penampil gambar','Afbeeldingsviewer')}"><div class="lightbox-top"><span id="image-caption"></span><button data-close>${U('close')} ×</button></div><div class="lightbox-stage"><button id="image-prev" aria-label="${L('Previous image','Gambar sebelumnya','Vorige afbeelding')}">←</button><img id="lightbox-image" alt=""><button id="image-next" aria-label="${L('Next image','Gambar berikutnya','Volgende afbeelding')}">→</button></div><div class="lightbox-bottom"><button id="image-zoom">${L('Zoom','Perbesar','Zoom')} +</button><span id="image-counter"></span><a id="image-original" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${L('Open original','Buka asli','Open origineel')} ↗</a></div></dialog></body></html>`;fs.mkdirSync(path.dirname(path.join(ROOT,dest)),{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(ROOT,dest),html);catalog.push({lang,route:r,file:dest,title});}
for(const l of D.LANGS){lang=l;write('',U('navHome'),home);write('work',U('navWork'),work);write('creative-work',L('Creative Work','Karya Kreatif','Creatief Werk'),creative);write('data-modeling',L('Data Modeling','Data Modeling','Datamodellering'),()=>dataModeling({L,link}));for(const ag of AGENTS_DETAIL)write('data-modeling/'+ag.slug,ag.name+' · '+L('AI agent','Agent AI','AI-agent'),()=>agentPage({L,link,slug:ag.slug}));write('education',U('navEducation'),education);write('leadership',U('navLeadership'),leadership);write('research',U('navResearch'),research);write('documents',L('Documents','Dokumen','Documenten'),documents);write('contact',U('navContact'),contact);for(const p of D.PROJECTS)write('work/'+p.slug,p.name,()=>projectDetail(p));D.LEADERSHIP.forEach((x,i)=>write('leadership/'+SL[i],x.org,()=>leadershipDetail(x,i)));write('leadership/field-notes',U('galleryTitle'),fieldNotes);D.RESEARCH.forEach(r=>write('research/'+r.slug,r.title,()=>reader(r)));D.DOCUMENTS.forEach((d,i)=>write('documents/'+['cv','bachelor','masters','thesis','certificates'][i],T(d.label),()=>docDetail(d,i)));D.SHOWCASE.forEach((s,i)=>write('creative-work/'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),mediaName(s,i),()=>mediaDetail(s,i)));}
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(ROOT,'brief/routes.json'),JSON.stringify(catalog,null,2));fs.writeFileSync(path.join(ROOT,'sitemap.xml'),'<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">'+catalog.map(c=>`<url><loc>https://eggan.vercel.app/${[c.lang==='nl'?'':c.lang,c.route].filter(Boolean).join('/')}</loc></url>`).join('')+'</urlset>');console.log('Built',catalog.length,'HTML pages.');
